    "detailed_description": "<strong>CATCH ME IF YOU CAN</strong> is a multiplayer hide &amp; seek game that immerses you into the world of Slavic mythology. Pick the role and play as one of the heroes, each having unique abilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready or not, here I come!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605870/extras/975d1d9e88a6b9c888cf9b1569014925.poster.avif?t=1716419316\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605870/extras/975d1d9e88a6b9c888cf9b1569014925.webm?t=1716419316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605870/extras/975d1d9e88a6b9c888cf9b1569014925.mp4?t=1716419316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The seekers have magic in their sleeves, which they can unleash at any moment. Teleporting and appearing right in front of the hider's coward face or using the powers of the forest to set a trap, and much more. It's magic! Their goal is to catch all the hiders getting in their way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This world is wonderful and seeks protection!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605870/extras/f8665b7674d1ad8dd39fe6b31cf314e5.poster.avif?t=1716419316\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605870/extras/f8665b7674d1ad8dd39fe6b31cf314e5.webm?t=1716419316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605870/extras/f8665b7674d1ad8dd39fe6b31cf314e5.mp4?t=1716419316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each hider has their own abilities to help them disguise and avoid getting caught. Transformation into objects, dash, invisibility, and more - all available to the hiders. Their task is to complete various missions located in different parts of the map, thereby calming the enraged hunter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time to have fun!</h2>Gather your friends and compete in agility, speed, and accuracy in <strong>CATCH ME IF YOU CAN</strong>!",
